[{"s":0,"a":3.2,"d":4.18,"text":"让 K8s 看见并调度每一张 GPU。","f":"265a1d6fe7.mp3","h":"265a1d6fe7","r":0},{"s":1,"a":0.6,"d":4.01,"text":"kubelet 不认识 GPU，要靠设备插件。","f":"812f36f025.mp3","h":"812f36f025","r":0},{"s":1,"a":5.6,"d":4.99,"text":"插件经 gRPC 注册，节点多出 8 个 GPU 资源。","f":"ea6050dc70.mp3","h":"ea6050dc70","r":7},{"s":1,"a":10.8,"d":4.82,"text":"Pod 申请整数张卡，设备和驱动库注入容器。","f":"e6ed5b903a.mp3","h":"e6ed5b903a","r":0},{"s":2,"a":0.6,"d":5.21,"text":"NFD 先给节点打标签，标出哪台有 NVIDIA 卡。","f":"45264e4fff.mp3","h":"45264e4fff","r":0},{"s":2,"a":6,"d":4.73,"text":"GPU Operator 用 ClusterPolicy 逐层部署组件。","f":"6c655cbfef.mp3","h":"6c655cbfef","r":0},{"s":2,"a":11.4,"d":4.61,"text":"最后 validator 跑 CUDA 程序，验证整条链路。","f":"5b81f7aaa6.mp3","h":"5b81f7aaa6","r":0},{"s":3,"a":0.6,"d":3.89,"text":"部署前最重要的决定：驱动装在哪里。","f":"ca3ff862c5.mp3","h":"ca3ff862c5","r":0},{"s":3,"a":5.6,"d":4.92,"text":"团队推荐宿主机驱动：变更可控，排查熟悉。","f":"914e2dff38.mp3","h":"914e2dff38","r":0},{"s":3,"a":10.8,"d":4.58,"text":"NVSwitch 机器还要装同版本的 Fabric Manager。","f":"2c19e3fcb4.mp3","h":"2c19e3fcb4","r":0},{"s":4,"a":0.6,"d":4.37,"text":"默认打分倾向把单卡任务分散到各节点。","f":"77285ba00c.mp3","h":"77285ba00c","r":0},{"s":4,"a":5.8,"d":4.44,"text":"每台都剩零散的卡，8 卡任务反而排不进。","f":"c05af1bedc.mp3","h":"c05af1bedc","r":0},{"s":4,"a":10.6,"d":4.68,"text":"改成 MostAllocated 装箱，GPU 权重设为 5。","f":"0ceb7fe783.mp3","h":"0ceb7fe783","r":0},{"s":5,"a":0.6,"d":4.42,"text":"time-slicing 把一张卡虚报成多份，轮流使用。","f":"79d9c0866e.mp3","h":"79d9c0866e","r":0},{"s":5,"a":5.8,"d":4.25,"text":"但没有显存隔离：一个 Pod 吃满，邻居 OOM。","f":"a7c7b3cdad.mp3","h":"a7c7b3cdad","r":0},{"s":5,"a":10.8,"d":4.22,"text":"MIG 把卡硬件切成最多 7 份，彼此隔离。","f":"1d145f9a19.mp3","h":"1d145f9a19","r":0},{"s":6,"a":0.8,"d":4.56,"text":"小结：让 K8s 认识并用好每一张 GPU。","f":"5a3f262af3.mp3","h":"5a3f262af3","r":5},{"s":6,"a":5.6,"d":4.13,"text":"下一课，用 Kueue 和 Volcano 做批调度。","f":"8f8f0d1175.mp3","h":"8f8f0d1175","r":0}]
